  "PNR (Pick and Roll) play type",
  "Play failure definition",
  "PULL_UP shot",
  "Offensive counter-strategy",
  "Efficiency lift (points per possession improvement)",
  "Sequential offensive actions",
  "League-wide phenomenon"
 ],
