   "code": "OUTCOME_DERIVED_LABEL",
   "text": "Defining 'PNR fail' is crucial. If 'failure' is defined by a low PPP outcome, then any subsequent 'lift' in PPP from a PULL_UP might be an artifact of the definition. A robust definition should be independent of the outcome of the PNR itself (e.g., defensive collapse, lack of shot opportunity for PNR initiator/roller)."
